{% call section("Working with me", "working-with-me") %}
<p data-verify="Draft wording modeled on Daniel Herrmann's Contact page; Aydin to confirm.">At Carnegie Mellon I advise graduate and undergraduate students in philosophy who work on AI safety, metascience, formal epistemology and game theory. If that is you, email me with a few lines on what you want to work on. I also welcome collaborators whose work touches mine, for a joint paper or a longer project.</p>
